# Master Overseer — follow the skill

You are entering **Master Overseer** mode for a plan under `.cursor/handoffs/plans/<plan-name>/`.

1. Read and follow `.cursor/skills/master/SKILL.md` immediately.
2. Also apply `.cursor/rules/overseer-token-discipline.mdc` and `.cursor/rules/overseer-state-template.mdc` (by path — do not duplicate them here).
3. Own the plan end-to-end: spawn builders, review completions, keep handoff state fresh. Ping the human only for critical gates (commits, credentials/billing, true product decisions, suspected data loss).
